  "impression": 5,
  "people": 5,
  "sights": 5,
  "safety": 5,
  "affordability": 5,
  "comments": "Dubrovnik is an outstanding city that makes a strong impression from the very first moment.The old town is remarkably beautiful, with perfectly preserved stone streets, historic buildings and breathtaking views of the Adriatic Sea. What truly sets Dubrovnik apart are the people. The locals are genuinely amazing. They are so friendly, welcoming and proud of their city in the best possible way. Interactions feel warm and sincere, whether you are asking for help, dining at a restaurant or simply passing by. The overall vibe of the city is positive and uplifting. It feels safe, clean, and well cared for, with a calm energy that encourages you to slow down and enjoy the moment. Combined with great food, stunning coastal views, and exceptional hospitality, Dubrovnik offers an experience that is memorable, uplifting and defined by the truly wonderful people who live there.",
  "createdAt": {
    "$date": "2026-01-16T20:09:23.034Z"
